      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. Can you also touch on the risks of what happens if we go too far in the other direction? If the pH drifts above 7.5, how does that affect the manganese uptake, and are there any specific signs of deficiency I should tell the vineyard manager to look for in the leaves?",
